            "Check and save": [
                "Yoxlay\u0131n v\u0259 saxlay\u0131n"
            ],
            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "Po\u00e7t siyah\u0131s\u0131 xidm\u0259tini bir d\u0259f\u0259 ba\u011flay\u0131n; bundan sonra ist\u0259nil\u0259n forma onu dolduran \u015f\u0259xsl\u0259ri siyah\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131zdan birin\u0259 \u0259lav\u0259 ed\u0259 bil\u0259r (forma blokunun t\u0259nziml\u0259m\u0259l\u0259ri \u2192 G\u00f6nd\u0259rdikd\u0259n sonra). A\u00e7arlar xidm\u0259t vasit\u0259sil\u0259 yoxlan\u0131l\u0131r, bu saytda \u015fifr\u0259l\u0259nmi\u015f \u015f\u0259kild\u0259 saxlan\u0131l\u0131r v\u0259 bir daha he\u00e7 vaxt g\u00f6st\u0259rilmir."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "He\u00e7 bir kod olmadan forma g\u00f6nd\u0259ri\u015fl\u0259rini v\u0259 d\u00fcym\u0259 klikl\u0259rini analitikan\u0131za g\u00f6nd\u0259rin. H\u0259min xidm\u0259ti \u00f6t\u00fcrm\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn ID sah\u0259sini bo\u015f burax\u0131n. D\u00fcym\u0259l\u0259r \u00f6z Qabaqc\u0131l panelind\u0259 \"Konversiya hadis\u0259si\" sah\u0259si \u0259ld\u0259 edir. Kuki banneri aktiv olduqda, ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i raz\u0131l\u0131q ver\u0259n\u0259 q\u0259d\u0259r he\u00e7 n\u0259 y\u00fckl\u0259nmir."
            ],
            "Google Analytics 4 measurement ID": [
                "Google Analytics 4 \u00f6l\u00e7m\u0259 ID-si"
            ],
            "Google Tag Manager container ID": [
                "Google Tag Manager konteyner identifikatoru"
            ],
            "Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)": [
                "Meta Pixel \u0130D (Meta Hadis\u0259 \u0130dar\u0259edicisind\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259ril\u0259n n\u00f6mr\u0259)"
            ],
            "Load these tags on my site": [
                "Bu teql\u0259ri sayt\u0131ma y\u00fckl\u0259yin"
            ],
            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "\u018fg\u0259r m\u00f6vzunuz v\u0259 ya ba\u015fqa bir qo\u015fma onlar\u0131 art\u0131q \u0259lav\u0259 edirs\u0259, s\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcn; hadis\u0259l\u0259r yen\u0259 d\u0259 g\u00f6nd\u0259ril\u0259c\u0259k."
            ],
            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "Form t\u0259qdimatlar\u0131 \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn hadis\u0259 ad\u0131"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Banner bloklarla dizayn etdiyiniz pop-up p\u0259nc\u0259r\u0259dir. Onun d\u00fcym\u0259l\u0259ri #consent-accept, #consent-reject v\u0259 #consent-save il\u0259 \u0259laq\u0259l\u0259nir (\"save\" \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn analytics v\u0259 marketing adl\u0131 i\u015far\u0259l\u0259m\u0259 xanalar\u0131 il\u0259 birlikd\u0259); h\u0259r hans\u0131 yerd\u0259 #consent-open linki onu yenid\u0259n g\u00f6st\u0259rir. Ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i q\u0259bul ed\u0259n\u0259 q\u0259d\u0259r izl\u0259m\u0259 teql\u0259ri y\u00fckl\u0259nmir, Google Consent Mode \"denied\" olaraq qal\u0131r v\u0259 sadalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z skriptl\u0259r s\u00f6n\u00fcl\u00fc v\u0259ziyy\u0259td\u0259 qal\u0131r."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "Haz\u0131r banner yarad\u0131n"
            ],
            "Show a cookie banner": [
                "Kuki bannerini g\u00f6st\u0259rin"
