            ],
            "Choose a popup\u2026": [
                "A\u00e7\u0131lan p\u0259nc\u0259r\u0259 se\u00e7in\u2026"
            ],
            "%s (draft)": [
                "%s (qaralama)"
            ],
            "Edit the banner": [
                "Banneri redakt\u0259 edin"
            ],
            "Remember the choice for (days)": [
                "Se\u00e7imi (g\u00fcn) m\u00fcdd\u0259tin\u0259 yadda saxlay\u0131n"
            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Avropa \u0130ttifaq\u0131, A\u0130M v\u0259 B\u00f6y\u00fck Britaniyadan k\u0259narda: ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i imtina ed\u0259n\u0259 q\u0259d\u0259r izl\u0259m\u0259ni y\u00fckl\u0259yin"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Qapal\u0131: h\u0259r bir ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i \u0259vv\u0259lc\u0259 raz\u0131la\u015fmal\u0131d\u0131r (\u0259n s\u0259rt qayda v\u0259 standart). A\u00e7\u0131q: yaln\u0131z hostunuz v\u0259 ya CDN ziyar\u0259t\u00e7inin \u00f6lk\u0259sini bildirdikd\u0259 (m\u0259s\u0259l\u0259n, Cloudflare-in CF-IPCountry ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131) v\u0259 bu, EU, EEA, B\u00f6y\u00fck Britaniya v\u0259 \u0130sve\u00e7r\u0259d\u0259n k\u0259narda olduqda. Banner h\u0259l\u0259 d\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259rilir v\u0259 nam\u0259lum \u00f6lk\u0259y\u0259 EU daxilind\u0259 oldu\u011fu kimi yana\u015f\u0131l\u0131r."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "Raz\u0131l\u0131q al\u0131nana q\u0259d\u0259r saxlan\u0131lacaq dig\u0259r skriptl\u0259r (handle:analytics v\u0259 ya handle:marketing, verg\u00fcll\u0259 ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f)"
            ],
